@startuml
!pragma layout elk
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5A6A
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontColor #4A5A6A
skinparam TitleFontSize 16
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #EFE6F8
  BorderColor #6A3FA0
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #C9B36B
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam stereotypeFontSize 10
hide circle
hide empty methods
title Logical ERD 5(d) - Topic follows and mutes
entity UserTopicFollow #EFE6F8;line:6A3FA0 {
  * userId <<PK,FK>>
  * topicKey <<PK>>
  --
  label
}
entity UserTopicMute #EFE6F8;line:6A3FA0 {
  * userId <<PK,FK>>
  * topicKey <<PK>>
  --
  label
}
entity User #FFFFFF;line:6A3FA0;line.dashed {
  * id <<PK>>
}
User ||--o{ UserTopicFollow
User ||--o{ UserTopicMute
legend bottom
Crow's-foot notation. PK primary key, FK foreign key, UK unique key.
Dashed boxes belong to another diagram (key only).
endlegend
@enduml
